# Pairs with ReconcilerNeverClaimsCommitted. A revision since the intent may
# be another writer's, so claiming a moved anchor as this call's commit
# asserts what the reconciler cannot prove.
MODULE: AuditReconcilerClaimsCommitted
TARGET: ReconcilerNeverClaimsCommitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reconciler claims a commit because the anchor moved
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
        verdict == CASE movement = "Moved" -> "Indeterminate"
--- REPLACE
        verdict == CASE movement = "Moved" -> "Committed"
--- END
